knext bundled fix for vinext 1.0.1 (dist output)
Upstream: https://github.com/cloudflare/vinext/pull/3681
What it fixes: experimental.lightningCssFeatures.include/exclude are forwarded to lightningcss's Vite transform options, but @custom-media is draft CSS syntax gated behind lightningcss's own drafts.customMedia parser flag -- a separate axis from the include/exclude transform mask. Without it, @custom-media fails to parse at all. Next.js derives drafts.customMedia from the same include list; this ports that derivation.
Retire: delete this file (and its manifest entry) when the pinned vinext is >= the first
release that includes cloudflare/vinext#3681.
Ported by hand from the upstream src change to the published 1.0.1 dist files.
Applied by `knext vinext-patches` (runs from the app's postinstall and before `knext build`).

--- a/dist/index.js
+++ b/dist/index.js
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
